WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.169
-Every night here at the show,

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.104
I deliver a monologue
like I just delivered.

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:08.107
It's comprised of jokes written
by a diverse team of writers.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.778
As a result, though, a lot
of jokes come across my desk

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.879
that due to my being
a straight, white male

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:15.648
would be difficult for me
to deliver.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.384
But we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.653
so we'd like to share them with
you now in a segment called

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.355
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.423 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause,
upbeat music plays ]

00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:26.226
[ Tape rips ]

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:29.229
These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:30.729
-I'm black.
-And I'm gay.

00:00:30.729 --> 00:00:32.264
-And we're both women!

00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:34.734
-And I'm not, so...

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.635
I'll read the setups
for these jokes,

00:00:36.635 --> 00:00:39.138
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:40.639
Here we go.

00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:44.511
Starbucks has discontinued its
gluten-free breakfast sandwich.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:47.347
-"That's the worst thing
Starbucks has ever done,"

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:48.715
said white people.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.351
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:54.019
-A lesbian-led event
called the Dyke March

00:00:54.019 --> 00:00:56.088
will be held next Saturday
in New York City.

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:58.691
-So if you see a bunch
of lesbians marching,

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.059
that's the Army.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.628
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:03.395
-Hey, can I go to the March?

00:01:03.395 --> 00:01:06.533
-Sure. Uh, it's BYOB --
Bring your own Birkenstocks.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:09.969
-According to Bloomberg,

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.838
the price of chicken wings
has fallen to a four-year low.

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:15.141
-Said black people,
"It's a trap!"

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.976
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:19.979
-Oh, oh, "It's a trap,"
like Admiral Ackbar.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:22.048
-Yeah, the way I do it,
it's Admiral Blackbar.

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:24.183
-[ Chuckles ] Okay.

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:25.551
According to a new study,

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:28.554
lesbians may be more likely
to develop type 2 diabetes

00:01:28.554 --> 00:01:29.622
than straight women.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.724
-Hmm.
I wonder what they're eating.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:35.428
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:39.765
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:42.535
-Prince Harry and Meghan Markle
broke with tradition

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:45.838
and served a lemon elderflower
cake at the royal wedding.

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:49.375
-Yeah, that's how
they broke with tradition.

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:51.144
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:53.479
-Hey, Amber, would you ever want
to be a princess?

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:54.780
-No.
-Why not?

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.884
-Because I'm not interested
in a demotion from Queen.

00:01:57.884 --> 00:01:59.819
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:03.422
-Oh, please...

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:04.624
-[ Chuckles ]

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.026
-Please,
please don't encourage this.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:07.927
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:09.195
-Cut back to me.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.130
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:11.965
-No, hey!

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:15.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:19.171
-A popular gay blog recently
published an article titled,

00:02:19.171 --> 00:02:21.373
"These are the best
lesbian sex positions."

00:02:21.373 --> 00:02:22.741
-Coming in at number one,

00:02:22.741 --> 00:02:25.378
whatever lets you finish in time
to watch Rachel Maddow.

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:26.945
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.945 --> 00:02:30.049
-Hey, Jenny, what is the best
position for lesbians?

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:31.250
-Shortstop.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:36.322
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.358
-A white Ya-- [ Chuckles ]

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:41.361
A white Yale student recently
called the police when she found

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:44.563
a black Yale student sleeping in
the common room of their dorm.

00:02:44.563 --> 00:02:46.265
-Said the black student,

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:49.502
"Hey, college did prepare me
for real life."

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:51.103
[ Audience laughs, groans ]

00:02:51.103 --> 00:02:52.605
-Hey, Amber...

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.574
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:56.175
-Where is the lie?

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:58.210
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.413
-Hey, Amber, what do you think
is the hardest thing

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:02.114
about a black student at Yale?

00:03:02.114 --> 00:03:04.516
-Being confused for the other
black student at Yale.

00:03:04.516 --> 00:03:05.351
-Oh, right, right, right.

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:06.953
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.955
A lesbian press in Michigan

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:11.290
recently won
four publishing awards.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.992
-A lesbian press is also
the technical term

00:03:13.992 --> 00:03:15.628
for a firm handshake.

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:17.095
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.095 --> 00:03:20.566
-So, Jenny, do lesbians
really have firm handshakes?

00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:23.435
[ Cracking ]
-Oh!

00:03:23.435 --> 00:03:24.370
Oh, Jenny.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.271
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:26.672
Ohh.
-Hey, Seth,

00:03:26.672 --> 00:03:27.639
why don't you tell one?

00:03:27.639 --> 00:03:30.009
-Ohh, you guys know I couldn't!

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:32.011
-Oh, come on, buddy. Just one!

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:34.112
-I feel like if I do one,
I'll get in trouble.

00:03:34.112 --> 00:03:35.481
-Come on. Just do it.

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:36.883
-You promise it will go okay?

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:38.584
-Pinky swear.
-Okay.

00:03:38.584 --> 00:03:39.452
[ Cracking ]
-Oh!

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:40.954
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.454
-Damn it!
-It's a trap!

00:03:42.454 --> 00:03:43.556
-You're a little --

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:44.791
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:47.226
You're a little late,
Admiral Blackbar.

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:50.029
-Hey, Admiral Blackbar
is always late.

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:51.397
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:53.166
That's how you know
he's Admiral Blackbar.

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.233
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:56.068
-Seth, dang,
will you tell a joke?!

00:03:56.068 --> 00:03:57.937
-All right! Geez!

00:03:57.937 --> 00:04:01.874
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:03.409
The former CEO --

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:06.445
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.445 --> 00:04:09.281
The former CEO of J. C. Penney

00:04:09.281 --> 00:04:11.217
