00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:18.758
[ Laughter ]
-Seth, no!

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:21.627
-Why?! That was exactly
what you were doing!

00:04:21.627 --> 00:04:22.895
-No!
-Very bad.

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:24.463
-I'll try again.
-Okay.

00:04:24.463 --> 00:04:26.832
Jennifer Aniston will play
a lesbian President

00:04:26.832 --> 00:04:28.534
in an upcoming Netflix movie.

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.936
A lesbian President is like
a regular President

00:04:30.936 --> 00:04:34.107
