in the oral office.

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.474
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.474 --> 00:04:37.109
-Seth, how dare you!

00:04:37.109 --> 00:04:39.445
-You told me it would be okay!

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:41.214
-You should be ashamed
of yourself!

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:42.982
-How dare you?!
-How could you do that?!

00:04:42.982 --> 00:04:46.151
You black women
and you lesbians are liars!

00:04:46.151 --> 00:04:47.653
[ Upbeat music plays ]

00:04:47.653 --> 00:04:49.255
[ Cheers and applause ]

